  "dominant_obstruction": "Every algebraic P-256 self-map induces log transport x->a*x+b. A connected affine transport graph reduces 164 logs only to one unknown anchor, whose free-oracle boundary is already 1.446505 times rho. Solving the anchor requires an independent known affine label and yields a scalar-labelled generic control; the registered direct instance costs 7.714692 times rho. No replayable non-affine quotient or complete below-rho pipeline is constructed.",
